# CreateParms

This niladic function returns a namespace with variables that represent all the possible parameters
that can be passed onto `Input` with their default values.

The namespace comes also with one method, `∆List`, which can be used to list all the names
together with their values:

~~~
      Input.CreateParms.∆List
 addToCaption              
 alignButtons         1    
 appendColon          1    
 autoPress           ¯1    
 cancel               1    
 cancelBtnCaption   Cancel 
 caption                   
 centerIn                  
 confirmCancel        0    
 debug                0    
 default              1    
 focus                     
 fontAPL                   
 fontInput                 
 fontLabel                 
 fontStandard              
 hGap                ¯1    
 hasProgressbar       0    
 hasStatusbar         1    
 helpBtnCaption            
 icon                      
 initialVgap         ¯1    
 menubar             ¯1    
 minSize           200 300 
 okBtnCaption           OK 
 onChange                  
 onHelp                    
 onInitial                 
 onInitialMsg              
 onKeyPress                
 onOkay                    
 onPushButton              
 parent                    
 parmType            Input 
 posn                      
 props                     
 regKey2             ¯1    
 selTextStyle         1    
 size                      
 testMode             0    
 timeout              0    
 tips                      
 vGap                 0.75 
 watchLength          1    
~~~
